          "text": "{current}/{required} Extinguish the Brazier of Hatred",
          "type": "object"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Using the Purified Moon Well Water, douse the flames of the four braziers of protection within Shadow Hold in Felwood, then return to Greta Mosshoof in the Emerald Sanctuary.",
      "title": "Dousing the Flames of Protection",
